0..77 Comment "//! A recursive call at a variable converts through the arm that waits on it."
78..147 Comment "//! `windWords(Loop(x))` runs to the `Loop` arm, whose `run` waits on"
148..228 Comment "//! `windWords(x)`, stuck at the variable; an endpoint\'s computation is pure, so"
229..292 Comment "//! the bind reads as the arm\'s constructor over the held call,"
293..372 Comment "//! `S(windWords(x))`, and the kernel replays the reading by forcing it. An arm"
373..450 Comment "//! that cases on the call before it returns keeps the call stuck, and a path"
451..528 Comment "//! stating a value for it is refused. Conversion is definitional equality by"
529..589 Comment "//! computation [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]."
590..593 Comment "//!"
594..650 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
651..654 Comment "//!"
